<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63798" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχωτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnished with a point, lance-headed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ba.</u>
					761
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγχεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					3.8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.172
			</span></i>; <i>lanceolate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.88
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>composed of</i>, or <i>ornamented with, spear-heads</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅρμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).161
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				23
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιάλη</span> ib.l.<i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχωτοὶ χιτῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Mag.</u>
					1.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογχωτόν, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλκανθές</span>
			, interpol. in <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.98
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				34.124
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
